#%RAML 1.0 DataType
(package): OrderEdit
example: !include ../../../examples/OrderEdit/StagedOrderSetDirectDiscountsAction.json
type: StagedOrderUpdateAction
displayName: StagedOrderSetDirectDiscountsAction
discriminatorValue: setDirectDiscounts
description: |
  Adds a [DirectDiscount](ctp:api:type:DirectDiscount) to the Order.

  If [Order](ctp:api:type:Order) `directDiscountsIgnoreCartDiscounts` is `true`, Direct Discounts can only be added when no [DiscountCode](ctp:api:type:DiscountCode) has been added to the Order.
properties:
  discounts:
    type: DirectDiscountDraft[]
    description: |
      - If set, all existing Direct Discounts are replaced.
        The discounts apply in the order they are added to the list.
      - If set to an empty array, all existing Direct Discounts are removed and all affected prices on the Order are recalculated.
